    \item Location: Askö Station, Sweden
    \item Duration: 4 hours continuous
    \item Acoustic accuracy: $\pm 0.3$ m
    \item Comm. success: 94\%
    \item Processing: 10 Hz real-time
    \item Weather: 1-2 m waves
\end{itemize}
